{"id":60,"slug":"60-aria-label-aria-labelledby-aria-describedby-khac-nhau","category":"HTML","subcategory":"Accessibility","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"aria-label, aria-labelledby, aria-describedby khác nhau?","question_en":"How do aria-label, aria-labelledby, and aria-describedby differ?","answer_vi":"Cả ba đều cấp tên hoặc mô tả cho screen reader, khác nhau ở **nguồn chữ** và **vai trò**.\n\n```html\n<!-- aria-label: đặt tên bằng chuỗi, khi không có chữ hiển thị -->\n<button aria-label=\"Đóng\">×</button>\n\n<!-- aria-labelledby: lấy tên từ element khác, nối nhiều id được -->\n<div role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"dlg-title\">\n  <h2 id=\"dlg-title\">Xác nhận xoá</h2>\n</div>\n\n<!-- aria-describedby: mô tả PHỤ, đọc sau tên -->\n<input id=\"pw\" type=\"password\" aria-describedby=\"pw-hint pw-err\">\n<p id=\"pw-hint\">Tối thiểu 8 ký tự</p>\n<p id=\"pw-err\" role=\"alert\"></p>\n```\n\n| | Nguồn | Vai trò | Ưu tiên |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `aria-labelledby` | id của element khác | **tên** | cao nhất |\n| `aria-label` | chuỗi viết thẳng | **tên** | thua labelledby |\n| `aria-describedby` | id của element khác | **mô tả thêm** | đọc sau tên |\n\nThứ tự tính tên: `aria-labelledby` > `aria-label` > `<label for>` > nội dung bên trong.\n\n**Lưu ý 1:** `aria-label` **đè lên chữ hiển thị**. Nút ghi \"Gửi đơn\" mà `aria-label=\"Submit\"` thì người dùng lệnh giọng nói đọc thấy \"Gửi đơn\" nhưng hệ thống lại chờ \"Submit\".\n\n**Lưu ý 2:** `aria-label` **không có tác dụng trên element không có role tương tác** như `<div>`, `<span>` thuần — nhiều screen reader bỏ qua hoàn toàn","answer_en":"All three give a screen reader a name or a description; they differ in **where the text comes from** and **what role it plays**.\n\n```html\n<!-- aria-label: name from a literal string, when there is no visible text -->\n<button aria-label=\"Close\">x</button>\n\n<!-- aria-labelledby: name from other elements; several ids allowed -->\n<div role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"dlg-title\">\n  <h2 id=\"dlg-title\">Confirm deletion</h2>\n</div>\n\n<!-- aria-describedby: EXTRA detail, announced after the name -->\n<input id=\"pw\" type=\"password\" aria-describedby=\"pw-hint pw-err\">\n<p id=\"pw-hint\">At least 8 characters</p>\n<p id=\"pw-err\" role=\"alert\"></p>\n```\n\n| | Source | Role | Priority |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `aria-labelledby` | ids of other elements | **name** | highest |\n| `aria-label` | inline string | **name** | loses to labelledby |\n| `aria-describedby` | ids of other elements | **extra description** | read after the name |\n\nName computation order: `aria-labelledby` > `aria-label` > `<label for>` > inner content.\n\n**Note 1:** `aria-label` **overrides visible text**. A button reading \"Send request\" with `aria-label=\"Submit\"` leaves voice-control users saying \"Send request\" while the system waits for \"Submit\".\n\n**Note 2:** `aria-label` **has no effect on elements without an interactive role**, such as a plain `<div>` or `<span>` — many screen readers ignore it entirely","answer_html_vi":"<p>Cả ba đều cấp tên hoặc mô tả cho screen reader, khác nhau ở <strong>nguồn chữ</strong> và <strong>vai trò</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- aria-label: đặt tên bằng chuỗi, khi không có chữ hiển thị --&gt;\n&lt;button aria-label=&quot;Đóng&quot;&gt;×&lt;/button&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- aria-labelledby: lấy tên từ element khác, nối nhiều id được --&gt;\n&lt;div role=&quot;dialog&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;dlg-title&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;h2 id=&quot;dlg-title&quot;&gt;Xác nhận xoá&lt;/h2&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- aria-describedby: mô tả PHỤ, đọc sau tên --&gt;\n&lt;input id=&quot;pw&quot; type=&quot;password&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;pw-hint pw-err&quot;&gt;\n&lt;p id=&quot;pw-hint&quot;&gt;Tối thiểu 8 ký tự&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p id=&quot;pw-err&quot; role=&quot;alert&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- aria-label: đặt tên bằng chuỗi, khi không có chữ hiển thị --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-label</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Đóng&quot;</span>&gt;</span>×<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- aria-labelledby: lấy tên từ element khác, nối nhiều id được --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;dialog&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-labelledby</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;dlg-title&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;dlg-title&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Xác nhận xoá<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- aria-describedby: mô tả PHỤ, đọc sau tên --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pw&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;password&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-describedby</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pw-hint pw-err&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pw-hint&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Tối thiểu 8 ký tự<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pw-err&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;alert&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Nguồn</th><th>Vai trò</th><th>Ưu tiên</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>aria-labelledby</code></td><td>id của element khác</td><td><strong>tên</strong></td><td>cao nhất</td></tr><tr><td><code>aria-label</code></td><td>chuỗi viết thẳng</td><td><strong>tên</strong></td><td>thua labelledby</td></tr><tr><td><code>aria-describedby</code></td><td>id của element khác</td><td><strong>mô tả thêm</strong></td><td>đọc sau tên</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Thứ tự tính tên: <code>aria-labelledby</code> &gt; <code>aria-label</code> &gt; <code>&lt;label for&gt;</code> &gt; nội dung bên trong.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý 1:</strong> <code>aria-label</code> <strong>đè lên chữ hiển thị</strong>. Nút ghi \"Gửi đơn\" mà <code>aria-label=\"Submit\"</code> thì người dùng lệnh giọng nói đọc thấy \"Gửi đơn\" nhưng hệ thống lại chờ \"Submit\".</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý 2:</strong> <code>aria-label</code> <strong>không có tác dụng trên element không có role tương tác</strong> như <code>&lt;div&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;span&gt;</code> thuần — nhiều screen reader bỏ qua hoàn toàn.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>All three give a screen reader a name or a description; they differ in <strong>where the text comes from</strong> and <strong>what role it plays</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- aria-label: name from a literal string, when there is no visible text --&gt;\n&lt;button aria-label=&quot;Close&quot;&gt;x&lt;/button&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- aria-labelledby: name from other elements; several ids allowed --&gt;\n&lt;div role=&quot;dialog&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;dlg-title&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;h2 id=&quot;dlg-title&quot;&gt;Confirm deletion&lt;/h2&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- aria-describedby: EXTRA detail, announced after the name --&gt;\n&lt;input id=&quot;pw&quot; type=&quot;password&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;pw-hint pw-err&quot;&gt;\n&lt;p id=&quot;pw-hint&quot;&gt;At least 8 characters&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p id=&quot;pw-err&quot; role=&quot;alert&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- aria-label: name from a literal string, when there is no visible text --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-label</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Close&quot;</span>&gt;</span>x<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- aria-labelledby: name from other elements; several ids allowed --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;dialog&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-labelledby</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;dlg-title&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;dlg-title&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Confirm deletion<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- aria-describedby: EXTRA detail, announced after the name --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pw&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;password&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-describedby</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pw-hint pw-err&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pw-hint&quot;</span>&gt;</span>At least 8 characters<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pw-err&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;alert&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Source</th><th>Role</th><th>Priority</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>aria-labelledby</code></td><td>ids of other elements</td><td><strong>name</strong></td><td>highest</td></tr><tr><td><code>aria-label</code></td><td>inline string</td><td><strong>name</strong></td><td>loses to labelledby</td></tr><tr><td><code>aria-describedby</code></td><td>ids of other elements</td><td><strong>extra description</strong></td><td>read after the name</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Name computation order: <code>aria-labelledby</code> &gt; <code>aria-label</code> &gt; <code>&lt;label for&gt;</code> &gt; inner content.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Note 1:</strong> <code>aria-label</code> <strong>overrides visible text</strong>. A button reading \"Send request\" with <code>aria-label=\"Submit\"</code> leaves voice-control users saying \"Send request\" while the system waits for \"Submit\".</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Note 2:</strong> <code>aria-label</code> <strong>has no effect on elements without an interactive role</strong>, such as a plain <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> or <code>&lt;span&gt;</code> — many screen readers ignore it entirely.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3-the-doctype-la-gi-tai-sao-can-khai-bao-doctype","title":"Thẻ DOCTYPE là gì? Tại sao cần khai báo DOCTYPE?"},{"url":"/q/4-cau-truc-co-ban-cua-mot-tai-lieu-html-bao-gom-nhung-gi","title":"Cấu trúc cơ bản của một tài liệu HTML bao gồm những gì?"},{"url":"/q/8-block-level-element-va-inline-element-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao-trong-html","title":"Block-level element và Inline element khác nhau như thế nào trong HTML?"},{"url":"/q/12-html-attribute-thuoc-tinh-la-gi-cho-vi-du","title":"HTML Attribute (thuộc tính) là gì? Cho ví dụ?"},{"url":"/q/13-boolean-attribute-trong-html-la-gi-cho-vi-du","title":"Boolean attribute trong HTML là gì? Cho ví dụ?"},{"url":"/q/14-custom-data-attribute-data-trong-html-la-gi","title":"Custom data attribute (data-*) trong HTML là gì?"},{"url":"/q/15-thuoc-tinh-id-va-class-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Thuộc tính `id` và `class` khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/16-semantic-html-la-gi-tai-sao-quan-trong","title":"Semantic HTML là gì? Tại sao quan trọng?"}]}